,0,0,'','','May my son Arthas always act in the best interest of his people.',237282,3,-1,0,0,0,32768),(286273,'Maiev Shadowsong\'s Silver Coin',0,1,0,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','','Where\'s Illidan?',237282,3,-1,0,0,0,32768),(286274,'Medivh\'s Silver Coin',0,1,0,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','','<You sense the ringing of three tones in your head, the third barely audible under the others\' din.>',237282,3,-1,0,0,0,32768),(286275,'Prince Magni Bronzebeard\'s Silver Coin',0,1,0,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','','I hope that my father and brothers outlive me. I\'ll not make much of a king.',237282,3,-1,0,0,0,32768),(286279,'Anduin Wrynn\'s Gold Coin',0,1,0,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','','I wish I would grow up, it feels like I\'ve been 10 for years.',237281,4,-1,0,0,0,32768),(286280,'Uther Lightbringer\'s Gold Coin',0,1,0,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','','Young Arthas must learn patience to temper his power. I will pray that he one day learns how to lead with care rather than force.',237281,4,-1,0,0,0,32768),(286281,'Arthas\' Gold Coin',0,1,0,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','','Already, I\'ve a kingdom in my prospects, a land to rule. What to ask for?  Perhaps a frozen scone...',237281,4,-1,0,0,0,32768),(286283,'Arugal\'s Gold Coin',0,1,0,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','','I wish someday to retire to my own tidy little estate, with a bunch of pet dogs to keep me company.',237281,4,-1,0,0,0,32768),(286284,'Brann Bronzebeard\'s Gold Coin',0,1,0,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','','Brann Bronzebeard was here.',237281,4,-1,0,0,0,32768),(286287,'Kel\'Thuzad\'s Gold Coin',0,1,0,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','','Sometimes... I wish someone would come along and just give me a big, long hug.',237281,4,-1,0,0,0,32768),(286288,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore\'s Gold Coin',0,1,0,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','','Arthas, my love, please come back to me.',237281,4,-1,0,0,0,32768),(286290,'Lady Katrana Prestor\'s Gold Coin',0,1,0,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'','','Listen, little wishing fountain. You\'ll give me all your power if you know what\'s good for you.',237281,4,-1,0,0,0,32768),(286291,'Sylvana